# SVG block diagram style

- Simple black outlines on white boxes, no fills or gradients
- Compact boxes with minimal internal padding, tight to text
- Vertical stacking of modules off a common bus line
- Sans-serif font, bold for module names, smaller gray text for addresses
- I/O labels on the right side showing external connections
- Dashed container for the parent module boundary
- BSB arrows showing command/reply flow into the router
- Modules without command interface shown outside the bus structure
- Clean, technical appearance; no decorative elements
- Reference example: images/SYSTEM/system.svg
